#   file and is itself called by the `sj()` wrapper that the startup gates use,
#   so returning true here short-circuits the dialog everywhere with one edit —
#   the same property the monolithic patch relies on.
#
# SCOPING (security-critical, unchanged): the bypass fires ONLY when
#   process.env.CLAUDIVERSE_SKIP_TRUST is set — a dedicated opt-in the spawner
