#   minified name is introduced. The context line `if (e.trustAccepted) return !0;`
#   was verified UNIQUE across the whole 2.1.260 tree, and `trustAccepted` /
#   `setTrustAccepted` are property names, which minification preserves.
#   The enclosing `$o` is minified but appears only in context.
#
# ⚠️ NOT EXERCISED BY THE TURN TEST (the test cwd is already trusted, and a
#   headless `-p` run does not reach the interactive trust gate). Applying and
#   bundling are VERIFIED; the live bypass is BELIEVED.
